You need some form of poison resistance, for until you find that you
will be forever in danger from Uruk-Hai arrows and spiked pit traps.

You need magic resistance, for you'll be in great danger from liches
if you hit the castle without it.

You'll want magic cancellation (from wearing most cloaks, with cloaks
of magic resistance, protection, oilskin or robes being best) to
protect you from assorted afflictions, level draining among them.

Other things too, but given what you have those things should be a
priority I'd say.

